<Title>Introduction</Title>
<Paragraph>
    In the process of internal desktop applications development, many different design specs and implementations can cause duplication and reduce development efficiency.
</Paragraph>
<Paragraph>
    Ant Design is a design language for background applications, which aims to
    <Text Strong>uniform interface specifications, reduce unnecessary costs, and free design and front-end resources</Text>.
</Paragraph>
<Title Level="2">Guidelines and Resources</Title>
<Paragraph>
    We supply design principles, practical patterns, and design resources such as <Text Code>Sketch</Text> and <Text Code>Axure</Text>.
</Paragraph>
<Paragraph>
    <ul>
        <li><a href="/docs/spec/proximity">Principles</a></li>
        <li><a href="/docs/pattern/navigation">Patterns</a></li>
        <li><a href="/docs/resource/download">Resource Download</a></li>
    </ul>
</Paragraph>
<Title>介绍</Title>
<Paragraph>
    蚂蚁的企业级产品体系庞大而复杂，设计与开发需要能够快速响应，并通过抽象获得稳定且高复用性的内容。
</Paragraph>
<Paragraph>
    基于<Text Mark>『确定』和『自然』</Text>的设计价值观，通过模块化解决方案降低冗余成本，让设计者专注于<Text Strong>更好的用户体验</Text>。
</Paragraph>
